293	     * {@code 'FY<YY>'} where {@code YY} is the last two digits of the fiscal year, e.g. {@code 'FY26'}.
294	     * The fiscal year starts on 1 July and is identified by the calendar year in which it ends: a date
295	     * from 1 July onwards belongs to the fiscal year ending in the following calendar year, and a date
296	     * before 1 July to the fiscal year ending in the same calendar year. Returns {@code null} when the
297	     * registration date is absent.
